{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead on Delivery</strong> is a chaotic action roguelite that puts you in the shoes of a determined pizza delivery driver committed to completing his job\u2014even in the middle of a zombie apocalypse! Play across 3 unique worlds, each filled with different hordes of the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT, SURVIVE, AND EVOLVE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/extras/ce258636a3ad957672081538c5486b7e.poster.avif?t=1772229598\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/extras/ce258636a3ad957672081538c5486b7e.webm?t=1772229598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/extras/ce258636a3ad957672081538c5486b7e.mp4?t=1772229598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat waves of enemies to progress and choose between random abilities after each stage (like &quot;Allied UFO,&quot; &quot;<strong>Moon Summoning</strong>,&quot; or even a &quot;<strong>Rocket Launcher</strong>&quot;) to adapt to the chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic management</strong>: choose between speed, strength, or defense to survive\u2014but be careful, time is running out and the pizza must stay hot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POWERFUL POWER-UPS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/extras/76bc88b0eb27b7019c6ac30afb022b7c.poster.avif?t=1772229598\" width=1170 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/extras/76bc88b0eb27b7019c6ac30afb022b7c.webm?t=1772229598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/extras/76bc88b0eb27b7019c6ac30afb022b7c.mp4?t=1772229598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent death, continuous progression: each run unlocks upgrades, abilities, and new cards to make you stronger for the next battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COME BACK STRONGER!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/extras/65157ea04a6b55b1341ef6f9443d5409.poster.avif?t=1772229598\" width=1170 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/extras/65157ea04a6b55b1341ef6f9443d5409.webm?t=1772229598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/extras/65157ea04a6b55b1341ef6f9443d5409.mp4?t=1772229598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the carnage, use the environment to your advantage: blow up fuel barrels, detonate cars, and crush zombies with your summons. But remember\u2014the customer is always right... even if it\u2019s a furious zombie craving your brain (and your pizza).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for a bloody delivery, brutal challenges, and the burning question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDo you have what it takes to be the Hero (and Delivery Driver) of the Apocalypse?\u201d</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725390?t=1772229598","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/68d455bedf72efcc8faa8beca6bf8a922dc2778b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772229598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/86f66403c1a699e5624874b74225e6d27ef13ea4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772229598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/86f66403c1a699e5624874b74225e6d27ef13ea4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772229598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead on Delivery</strong> is a chaotic action roguelite that puts you in the shoes of a determined pizza delivery driver committed to completing his job\u2014even in the middle of a zombie apocalypse! Play across 3 unique worlds, each filled with different hordes of the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT, SURVIVE, AND EVOLVE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/extras/ce258636a3ad957672081538c5486b7e.poster.avif?t=1772229598\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/extras/ce258636a3ad957672081538c5486b7e.webm?t=1772229598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725390/extras/ce258636a3ad957672081538c5486b7e.mp4?t=1772229598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_pa